'''Nikos Alexiou''' ({{langx|el|Νίκος Αλεξίου}}; 1960–2011) was a [[Greeks|Greek]] artist who specialized in [[Visual arts|visual art]], [[contemporary art]], [[installation art]] and [[Scenic design|set design]] for theatre and dance. He exhibited his work at personal exhibitions and group events both in Greece and abroad.
